WEBVTT

00:00:00.930 --> 00:00:32.510
<v Ira Glass>"I'll pour this pestilence into his ear. So will I make the net that will enmesh them all." It's an adult, Iago, who says that in Othello. And it's grownups that Machiavelli was writing about when he wrote The Prince , his book about manipulating others and seizing power. Notice he titled the book The Prince , not The Little Prince. The Little Prince is actually by somebody else, if you don't know that.
<v Ira Glass>“我要将这瘟疫灌入他的耳中，我将设下罗网，将他们一网打尽。” 这话出自《奥赛罗》中的伊阿古，一位成年人。马基雅维利在撰写《君主论》时，书中关于操纵他人和夺取权力的内容，讨论的对象也是成年人。注意他将书名定为《君主论》（The Prince），而不是《小王子》（The Little Prince）。如果你不知道的话，得提一下，《小王子》是另一位作者写的。

00:00:32.510 --> 00:01:12.550
<v Ira Glass>But in our American lives, the real era of intrigue and manipulation for most of us is not adulthood. It's adolescence, when our social circle is at its most constricting. Today on our program, a story of betrayal and of someone who holds David Koresh-like powers over others, and who is only in the seventh grade. From WBEZ in Chicago, it's Your Radio Playhouse . I'm Ira Glass.
<v Ira Glass>但在我们的美国生活中，对大多数人来说，真正的阴谋与操纵时期并非成年，而是青春期，那时我们的社交圈最为狭窄。今天我们的节目将讲述一个背叛的故事，主角是一个在七年级就对他人生杀予夺，拥有大卫·考雷什般权力的人。这里是芝加哥 WBEZ 电台的《你的广播剧场》（Your Radio Playhouse），我是艾拉·格拉斯。

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:22.690
<v Ira Glass>But before we get into the body of our story, we will try, as adults, to manipulate you a little bit at Pledge Central. Let's check in with Pledge Central. Shirley Jahad.
<v Ira Glass>但在进入故事正题之前，我们要以成年人的身份，在认捐中心（Pledge Central）稍微“操纵”一下各位。让我们连线认捐中心，雪莉·贾哈德。

00:01:22.690 --> 00:01:23.890
<v Shirley Jahad>Hi, Ira Glass.
<v Shirley Jahad>你好，艾拉·格拉斯。

