00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:27.410
<v Ira Glass>And finally, we have this thing. Two weeks ago, we had a show where Julia Sweeney told the story of getting cancer. And she told the story of herself getting cancer and of her brother getting cancer. And she told them as stand-up comedy. And she was telling this in a place called Un-Cabaret. It's a club in Los Angeles where essentially, comics come each week, and they tell what are basically comic diary versions of their week.
<v Ira Glass>最后，我们还有这个。两周前，我们有一期节目，茱莉亚·斯威尼讲述了她患癌症的故事。她讲述了自己患癌以及她哥哥患癌的经历。她以单口喜剧的形式讲述这些故事。她是在一个叫“非歌舞表演”（Un-Cabaret）的地方表演的。那是一家位于洛杉矶的俱乐部，喜剧演员们每周都会来这里，分享他们本周生活的喜剧日记版本。

